[
  {
    "content_id": "10064001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作長老的寫信給親愛的該猶，就是我誠心所愛的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;親愛的兄弟啊，我願你凡事興盛，身體健壯，正如你的靈魂興盛一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;有弟兄來證明你心裏存的真理，正如你按真理而行，我就甚喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我聽見我的兒女們按真理而行，我的喜樂就沒有比這個大的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;親愛的兄弟啊，凡你向作客旅之弟兄所行的都是忠心的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他們在教會面前證明了你的愛；你若配得過上帝，幫助他們往前行，這就好了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因他們是為主的名出外，對於外邦人一無所取。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;所以我們應該接待這樣的人，叫我們與他們一同為真理做工。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我曾略略地寫信給教會，但那在教會中好為首的丟特腓不接待我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以我若去，必要提說他所行的事，就是他用惡言妄論我們。還不以此為足，他自己不接待弟兄，有人願意接待，他也禁止，並且將接待弟兄的人趕出教會。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;親愛的兄弟啊，不要效法惡，只要效法善。行善的屬乎上帝；行惡的未曾見過上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;低米丟行善，有眾人給他作見證，又有真理給他作見證，就是我們也給他作見證。你也知道我們的見證是真的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我原有許多事要寫給你，卻不願意用筆墨寫給你，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但盼望快快地見你，我們就當面談論。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰三書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;願你平安。眾位朋友都問你安。請你替我按着姓名問眾位朋友安。</p>"
  }
]